    "name": "Simple Trains",
    "steam_appid": 2095480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095480/extras/750ace8ebd5f3af4cac939a340cf857e.poster.avif?t=1720861239\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095480/extras/750ace8ebd5f3af4cac939a340cf857e.webm?t=1720861239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095480/extras/750ace8ebd5f3af4cac939a340cf857e.mp4?t=1720861239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Connect</h2>Drag routes from station to station to connect them. Tie new stations into existing routes and optimize passenger flow by rerouting and adjusting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage</h2>Transporting passengers generates revenue. Use this to buy new trains and wagons. Drag and drop trains or wagons from one route to another to keep the load balanced.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 8 unique upgrades including 4 station upgrades (Spawn type Switch, Station Switch, Increase Capacity, Faster Boarding), 2 train upgrades (Specialist Wagon, Rocket Wagon) and 2 passive upgrades (Cheaper Trains, Cheaper Wagons) <br></li><li> Focus mode for painless spawn type analysis<br></li><li> Money mechanic: Passengers generate income which can be used to buy trains and wagons<br></li><li> 14 Levels + 1 Daily Challenge<br></li><li> A seed based random level generator<br></li><li> Light and dark-mode color schemes<br></li><li> Ranking tables for each Level</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095480/extras/750ace8ebd5f3af4cac939a340cf857e.poster.avif?t=1720861239\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095480/extras/750ace8ebd5f3af4cac939a340cf857e.webm?t=1720861239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095480/extras/750ace8ebd5f3af4cac939a340cf857e.mp4?t=1720861239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Connect</h2>Drag routes from station to station to connect them. Tie new stations into existing routes and optimize passenger flow by rerouting and adjusting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage</h2>Transporting passengers generates revenue. Use this to buy new trains and wagons. Drag and drop trains or wagons from one route to another to keep the load balanced.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 8 unique upgrades including 4 station upgrades (Spawn type Switch, Station Switch, Increase Capacity, Faster Boarding), 2 train upgrades (Specialist Wagon, Rocket Wagon) and 2 passive upgrades (Cheaper Trains, Cheaper Wagons) <br></li><li> Focus mode for painless spawn type analysis<br></li><li> Money mechanic: Passengers generate income which can be used to buy trains and wagons<br></li><li> 14 Levels + 1 Daily Challenge<br></li><li> A seed based random level generator<br></li><li> Light and dark-mode color schemes<br></li><li> Ranking tables for each Level</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Simple Trains is a transit simulation game where you build efficient railroad networks and manage trains and routes. Streamline complex passenger flow utilizing eight unique upgrades!",
